    pTag: 
    expand: 0
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    vars: []
    varKeys: []
    isPlayer: 1
  - commentCount: 3
    s_comment:
    - text: "O co chodzi\u0142o z tym stanem niewa\u017Cko\u015Bci i ruchem dooko\u0142a
        planety?"
      extraData: ExtraData
      inputSetIndex: 22
      outputNodeIndex: 23
      outActionIndex: -1
      showmore: 0
      outRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 301
        y: 61
        width: 30
        height: 46
      sprites: {fileID: 0}
      audios: {fileID: 0}
      visible: 1
    - text: Co to mikrograwitacja?
      extraData: ExtraData
      inputSetIndex: 22
      outputNodeIndex: 24
      outActionIndex: -1
      showmore: 0
      outRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 300
        y: 108
        width: 30
        height: 22
      sprites: {fileID: 0}
      audios: {fileID: 0}
      visible: 1
    - text: "Gdzie my jeste\u015Bmy?"
      extraData: ExtraData
      inputSetIndex: 22
      outputNodeIndex: 25
      outActionIndex: -1
      showmore: 0
      outRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 300
        y: 131
        width: 30
        height: 22
      sprites: {fileID: 0}
      audios: {fileID: 0}
      visible: 1
    ID: 22
    rect:
      serializedVersion: 2
      x: 5710
      y: -180
      width: 348
      height: 195.33333
    pTag: 
    expand: 0
    sprite: {fileID: 0}
    vars: []
    varKeys: []
    isPlayer: 1
  - commentCount: 2
    s_comment:
    - text: "To po\u0142\u0105czenie si\u0142y grawitacji i ogromnej pr\u0119dko\u015Bci.
        Wyobra\u017A sobie, \u017Ce chcesz przeskoczy\u0107 pi\u0142k\u0119. Je\u015Bli
        po prostu skoczysz pionowo, wyl\u0105dujesz na niej. Je\u015Bli jednak skoczysz
        w prz\xF3d, a jeszcze lepiej, je\u015Bli mocno si\u0119 rozp\u0119dzisz,
        mo\u017Cesz j\u0105 przeskoczy\u0107."
      extraData: ExtraData
      inputSetIndex: 23
      outputNodeIndex: 26
      outActionIndex: -1
      showmore: 0
      outRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 301
        y: 61
        width: 30
        height: 134
      sprites: {fileID: 0}
      audios: {fileID: 0}
      visible: 1
    - text: "My na ISS jeste\u015Bmy tak rozp\u0119dzeni, \u017Ce za ka\u017Cdym
        razem \u201Eprzeskakujemy\u201D Ziemi\u0119, poruszaj\u0105c si\u0119 w k\xF3\u0142ko
        wok\xF3\u0142 niej. Takie okr\u0105\u017Canie planety to ruch po orbicie."
      extraData: ExtraData
      inputSetIndex: 23
      outputNodeIndex: -1
      outActionIndex: -1
      showmore: 0
      outRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 0
        y: 0
        width: 0
        height: 0
      sprites: {fileID: 0}
      audios: {fileID: 0}
      visible: 1
    ID: 23
